 "remarks": "Welcome to 24 Quaker Road! Beautifully renovated with exceptional attention to detail, this stunning home offers 4 spacious bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and approximately 1,981 sq. ft. of finished living space, including the lower level (municipal records pending update). Nestled near the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, this home features a bright, open-concept living and dining area flowing into a gorgeous modern kitchen with quartz countertops, a matching quartz backsplash, a generous center island, and beautiful cabinetry. A bright, sun-filled office/sunroom offers the perfect space for working from home or relaxing. The main level features a primary bedroom with a private half bath and an exceptionally spacious second bedroom. The beautifully finished lower level offers two additional bedrooms, a generous family room with a charming fireplace, and a stylish full bathroom with a bathtub and modern all-in-one washer/dryer combo. Don't miss Mud Room/ Storage Room/ Mechanical Room Combo! Additional highlights include an attached garage, ample storage, and thoughtfully selected finishes throughout. Exterior siding is primarily wood, with vinyl siding at the rear of the sunroom and Bedroom #4. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, major highways, Costco, Home Depot, Best Buy, and more. A truly move-in-ready home that combines style, comfort, and versatile living space. Don't miss this exceptional opportunity!",
